SOAPBOX: This contest was Murphy against WA1FCN.  The winner was WA1FCN.
SOAPBOX: It was a tough one, that needed a drastic call.  My backup computer
SOAPBOX: that runs WSJTX/TS870/MicroHam Interface3, stoped working completely
SOAPBOX: just before contest start.
SOAPBOX: I ended up taking one of the hard drives out of
SOAPBOX: main computer and putting hard drive from
SOAPBOX: backup computer.  When I turned computer on
SOAPBOX: OMG it booted up.  the screen was a little messed
SOAPBOX: up tho.  All software was there and radio combination
SOAPBOX: worked !  My log has 304 QSO's with no dupes
SOAPBOX: but Writelog report says  258 Qso's ? I don't
SOAPBOX: understand it.
